# Trivy ignore list — CVEs reviewed and accepted as non-exploitable in this
# deployment's actual architecture. See project report for full triage notes.
# Re-review each entry periodically in case an upstream fix becomes available.

# chromadb: pre-auth RCE requires a network-exposed chromadb server.
# This service uses chromadb.PersistentClient() (embedded mode) only —
# no HttpClient, no separate chromadb port/service. Not reachable.
CVE-2026-45829

# glib: D-Bus introspection XML parsing. Not invoked by this Python/FastAPI service.
CVE-2026-58016

# libxml2 (AI service base image): no XML parsing in this codebase
# (confirmed: no lxml or XML libraries in requirements.txt).
CVE-2026-6653

# perl / perl-base / Storable / perl-archive-tar: base Debian image includes
# Perl by default; this service never invokes it (Python-only application).
CVE-2026-13221
CVE-2026-42496
CVE-2026-57433
CVE-2026-8376